<title>CANADA: Alcan Q1 share profit rises after gain.</title>
<headline>Alcan Q1 share profit rises after gain.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			    1996</p>
<p> Shr			US$0.62		  US$0.53</p>
<p> Net			143,000		  125,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,870,000		1,999,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Results for the first quarter of 1997 include after-tax gains of US$36 million, or 16 US cents per share. These comprise a gain on the sale of downstream businesses in South America of US$10 million and a favourable income tax adjustment.</p>
<p>First-quarter 1996 results include a US$12 million after-tax charge as a result of repaying US$232 million of debentures.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
</text>
